=== Keyboard Shortcuts ===
    Esc               Give the focus back to the list
  Writing in the chat:
    Enter             Send the message
    Tab               Go to the list and keep the draft
    Esc               Stop writing and keep the draft
    Backspace/Delete  Delete the previous character
    Alt+Backspace/Ctrl+W
                      Delete the previous word
── Video ──
  Space               Pause or resume the video
  +/=                 Turn the volume up
  -/_                 Turn the volume down
  m                   Mute or unmute the sound
  Ctrl+X              Stop the video
  r                   Retry the video that failed or, without one, the list
── Window and layout ──
  Ctrl+W w            Cycle the layouts: split, chat, list and focus
  Ctrl+W h            Show or hide the left panel
  Ctrl+W l            Show or hide the right panel; under 80 columns, open the chat alone
  Esc                 Leaves the layout alone; to change it, use Ctrl+W w, Ctrl+W h or Ctrl+W l
  Window only:
    Ctrl+W o/Ctrl+O   Put the chat over the video or beside it
    Ctrl+W x          Swap the sides of the list and the chat
    Alt+↑/Ctrl+W +    Increase overlay chat height
    Alt+↓/Ctrl+W -    Decrease overlay chat height
    Alt+PgUp          Make the chat background more opaque
    Alt+PgDn          Make the chat background more transparent
    Ctrl+→            Move the list divider to the right
    Ctrl+←            Move the list divider to the left
    Alt+←/Ctrl+W <    Move the chat divider to the left
    Alt+→/Ctrl+W >    Move the chat divider to the right
    Ctrl+B            Show or hide the list
── Settings ──
  Language: en · change it with --lang en or --lang pt-BR
  No color: NO_COLOR disables color · symbols ▸ ★ ● ▶ ‖ ✖ ! still show state
  Colors: green = ●/[live] and viewers · yellow = pause and ★ favorite/pinned · cyan = focus · red = error/[offline] ·
    magenta = system · mention with underline
